<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>Edit Post — Neon Notes</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css"></head>
<body><main class="edit-page">
<header class="topbar"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-icon" aria-hidden="true">N</span> NEON<span class="muted">/</span>NOTES</a><a class="text-link" href="/">← Back to your posts</a></header>
<section class="edit-intro"><p class="eyebrow">NOTE / <%= String(post.id).padStart(2, '0') %></p><h1>A little refinement.</h1><p class="intro">Good ideas evolve. Make this one yours.</p></section>
<section class="panel edit-panel"><h2>Edit your post</h2><form class="editor-form" action="/posts/<%= post.id %>/edit" method="POST">
<label for="title">POST TITLE</label><input id="title" type="text" name="title" value="<%= post.title %>" required>
<label for="content">YOUR STORY</label><textarea id="content" name="content" rows="12" required><%= post.content %></textarea>
<div class="edit-actions"><button class="primary" type="submit">Save changes <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><a class="cancel" href="/">Cancel</a></div>
</form></section><footer class="footer"><span>NEON / NOTES</span><span>Keep creating.</span></footer>
</main></body></html>
